{"id":"omv264ld34nb34mc1neugkdie","title":"我破解了健身房强制使用的社交应用","originalTitle":"My gym forced a social media down my throat. So I reverse-engineered its app","summary":"我最近加入了一家健身房，发现其应用首页为社交动态，每次使用都强制展示类似 Tinder 的内容。为摆脱这一强制推送，我通过反向工程提取了 QR 码逻辑，并成功开发了一个独立的 SvelteKit 应用来生成二维码，从而避免了每次使用时被社交应用打扰。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Hacker News 热榜"},"links":{"original":"https://shayon.work/blog/reverse-engineering-gym-pass"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-05T17:30:17.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-05T18:02:35.566Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-05T18:02:35.566Z","category":"cool-repos","tags":["新项目","技术方案"],"score":33,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"6d6f686e-a792-465f-9bea-753946cadce3","title":"用户反向工程健身房社交应用并开发替代方案"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"6d6f686e-a792-465f-9bea-753946cadce3","title":"用户反向工程健身房社交应用并开发替代方案"}],"topics":[{"slug":"new-project","name":"新项目首发"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fnMB4gWCa6_I","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}